# Never track backups, caches, or secrets
*.bak
*.bak.*
*~
.dotfiles-backup/

# Defensive: never commit anything that could hold secrets/private data,
# even if accidentally copied into the repo tree.
**/google-chrome/
**/chromium/
**/mozilla/
**/pulse/
**/dconf/
**/copyq/
**/yay/
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.netrc
**/*api*key*
